  "promoteThreshold": 2,
  "windowDays": 7,
  "demoteAfterDays": 14,
  "maxHot": 28,
  "_notes": "Add more *-manifest.json (mongodb-manifest.json, writing-manifest.json) to `manifests` to tier those families too. promoteThreshold = accesses within windowDays to move a cold spoke into the index; demoteAfterDays = idle days before a hot spoke returns to cold; maxHot = LRU cap on promoted standalones so the index cannot re-bloat."
